  "worked_solution": "The general equation of forced harmonic motion with damping is\n\n$$\nm{y}^{\u2033}=-c{y}^{\u2032}-ky+F(t).\n$$\n\nSubstituting our values for $m,$ $k,$ $c$ and $F(t)$ gives\n\n$$\n3{y}^{\u2033}=-12{y}^{\u2032}-15y+6{e}^{4t}.\n$$\n\nSimplifying and rearranging the above equation, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+4{y}^{\u2032}+5y=2{e}^{4t}.\n$$",
